OL,6,FWarning: This article includes
OL,7,Freferences to extreme sexual activities
OL,8,Fwhich some readers may find upsetting.
OL,10,FA woman said she was shocked and
OL,11,Fdisgusted by what she described as a
OL,12,F"depraved" adults-only section of a
OL,13,Ffamily Halloween attraction.
OL,15,FRobyn Doughty said she expected "fun
OL,16,Fscares" at Newsham Scream Park in
OL,17,FLiverpool but the optional Hellfire
OL,18,FClub experience included obscene sexual
OL,19,Flanguage and physical elements for
OL,20,Fwhich there had been no adequate
OL,21,Fwarning.
